{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0103_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a1fc01f347079bb5937f7bfc670a4ddfd752abecd3779be3f0f27d8c12946bf8", "ja": "（お祭りのライブパレードに出演するため、\n風花と現地入りした。かなり早く着いてしまったな）", "zh": "（为了参与庆典的演唱会游行表演，\n我和风花一起前往当地，却不小心太早到了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0103_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "133981ab65b02021c9c572dd8a99e95a7784f02d27e9a4fb076c02149dd57ce2", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ついにきましたね！\n私、今日のイベント、とっても楽しみにしてたんです！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，终于到这一天了呢！\n我一直都很期待今天的活动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0103_1002_p", "source_sha256": "372529f7cb97b0cb97fada908ea373b78a941dda93806f22d5bed7b051cf8d70", "ja": "風花、気合いが入ってるな！　そういえば\n行きの飛行機でも、テンションが高かったような……。", "zh": "风花，你很有干劲呢！这么说来，\n在来这里的飞机上，你的情绪似乎也很高昂……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0103_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e8b7ff543dfbd8246a201f40a8b68c21560d3350ed8c1900cdd8f969031d66f8", "ja": "ふふっ♪　だって……桜並木の大通りでパレード\nなんて、正統派アイドルっぽいじゃないですか！", "zh": "呵呵♪因为……在樱花树夹道相迎的街道上游行，\n超有正统派偶像的感觉嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0103_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "accb848229f3bfb33411f80f929e1b66ffc816dd69b8453dcb32f8a8c90572b1", "ja": "楽しみすぎて、昨日の夜は\nなかなか寝付けなかったくらいで……♪", "zh": "我实在太期待了，\n期待到昨天晚上差点睡不着觉……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0103_1005_p", "source_sha256": "00ccf05aa442b59af4d214e91b8a330b94d314cc98a98dc134e92186a76c6291", "ja": "はは、そうだったのか。\nなんだか、遠足前の小学生みたいだな。", "zh": "哈哈，原来如此。\n感觉很像远足前一天的小学生呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0103_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e658a5b7b8434a28757c1be8f86cfad76623071d80085ecfbb1dd81470230911", "ja": "言われてみれば、そうですね……\n私、ひとりで浮かれすぎ……？", "zh": "听你这么一说，好像是耶……\n我自己兴奋过头了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0103_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9536e39364da5bbfa128acf41b78cc1e28c385669d6ab564a80b1d346623b79a", "ja": "ち、ちょっと恥ずかしいですね……うぅ。", "zh": "有、有点难为情耶……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0103_1008_p", "source_sha256": "5e65356163af280b3775984b49f87783be870d63870665e94eed8493fea613e1", "ja": "いや、こっちまで楽しい気分になってきたよ。\nパレードも、そんな感じでよろしくな！", "zh": "不会啦，我的心情也跟着轻快起来了。\n就用这种感觉参加游行吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0103_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "df60d90267c020af16d94fd04482f36cb628249bbd68b412dc217c35edf50e8d", "ja": "あ……は、はいっ♪\nみなさんに楽しんでもらえるように……ですね！", "zh": "啊……好、好的♪\n要努力让大家开心……对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0103_1010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ded80f137ecf3ad901adfec599f8ec507354c21a78e74ed01570310330ae1d32", "ja": "あとは、お客さんが、たくさん来てくれると\nいいんですけど……。", "zh": "另外就是，\n希望会有很多观众来看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0103_1011_p", "source_sha256": "957b82ea72d924fe23d050ade3fdc8837084d4ca9b7623d8c3cef4b22d049871", "ja": "来てくれるさ。\nだからこそ、しっかり準備しておかないと。", "zh": "一定会的，\n所以现在得好好准备才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0103_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "97d5830020ace90f561287c0dc910dd0923e59b326d9bbcfccb19662f7f6f6cd", "ja": "はいっ！　あ、そうだ。{$P$}さん、\n今からパレードの通りを見に行ってもいいですか？", "zh": "好的！啊，对了，{$P$}先生，\n我现在可以去要游行的那条街道看看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0103_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a137133bcd6bf8e6d58420152a724eaf97986f43bbd356151becb31c6ead8a60", "ja": "お仕事の前に、一度、自分の足で歩いて\nイメージしておきたいんです！", "zh": "我想在工作前自己先去走一趟，\n想像一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0103_1014_p", "source_sha256": "f07d1337567ff6bb4ab58d35aa07b821f2853ce7fe95fc452a4c39d204965f7c", "ja": "うん、いいんじゃないか？\nそういう事なら、俺も付き合うよ。", "zh": "嗯，不错啊。\n如果是为了这个，那我跟你一起去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0103_1015_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ebd60d0248680a12968686da308ba1df69a0f0ad05382d3970c6691bb7ba65c1", "ja": "でも{$P$}さん、\n他にもお仕事があるんじゃ……。", "zh": "但是，{$P$}先生，\n你不是还有其他工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0103_1016_p", "source_sha256": "115fe63fe99f86576d012c3a33add878af635edb32fa465d214d834e53c7133d", "ja": "まだ次の仕事まで時間があるし……それに、せっかく\nいい天気だしな。散歩も悪くないと思って。", "zh": "距离下一项工作还有一段时间……\n而且天气难得这么好，去散个步也不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0103_1017_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d652693afbbdffb7a746c2027d379c110b34a11320ed359a33f08774c3e85057", "ja": "ふふっ♪　そうですね。\n桜も、綺麗ですし……運動がてら、歩きましょうか？", "zh": "呵呵♪就是说呢。\n樱花也很漂亮……就当是运动，顺便走走吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0103_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "63da7413350cf23a6db1ea7108f1b43a246a957c65e626c9054ed019f3ce5794", "ja": "桜の中をふたりで……なんだか素敵ですね。\nエスコート、よろしくお願いします♪", "zh": "两个人在樱花下漫步……感觉好棒。\n就拜托你当护花使者啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
